RELEASE HISTORY

1.6.2 31/05/2019
! Fix support for conditional menu episode conditions using dot notation to identify section (e.g. admission.ascreen) and ConditionalMenu.condition_episode=1 setting

1.6.1 05/10/2018
! Resolved issue if there are no child fields in ConceptGroup field

1.6.0 14/09/2018
* Compatibility change for clinicle/clinicle
+ Support for embedding in non-DB forms
+ Delete section button included in top-menu

1.5.3 10/08/2017
! If concept group field marked as deleted, child fields within not being deleted during install
! Concept group fields not added if page uses a Form_File component

1.5.2 24/07/2017
! Prevent failure if no Conditional menu component

1.5.1 18/07/2017
! Ignore sorting if no weight to avoid reversing menu items

1.5.0 13/07/2017
+ Weight-based sorting of top menu items

1.4.0 01/11/2016
+ Allow extension of ConditionTopMenu functions with sub-class
+ Added weights to MRC grade

1.3.0 20/04/2016
+ 'hide_topmenu' setting to allow episode menu to be used instead
! If required delete child fields within a concept group and run their beforeInstall() functions

1.2.3 22/02/2016
! Support for 'no-menu' setting had been removed
! Use 'href' rather than JS to link to page for ConfirmSave to work properly

1.2.2 08/02/2015
! ConditionalTopSection now supports arrays of values and Menu is always added to child pages

1.2.1 02/02/2015
! Page lookup not working correctly

1.2.0 27/01/2015
+ Support for ConceptGroup pages in other modules

1.1.0 10/12/2015
+ Conditional menu logic moved from PR module

1.0.2 13/05/2015
! Resolved problem with respiratory physiology modal input

1.0.1 12/11/2014
! Increased size of smoking item type

1.0.0 17/09/2014
* Initial version including LungFunction and standard height/weight measures along with MRC grade
+ Tobacco conversion dictionary
